{
	"_readme": [
		"Lookup and reference built-ins: ADDRESS CHOOSE COLUMN COLUMNS HLOOKUP INDEX",
		"MATCH ROW ROWS VLOOKUP XLOOKUP.",
		"",
		"Standard grid used by most fixtures (sorted ascending on column A):",
		"  A1:C4 = 10 'ten' 'X1' / 20 'twenty' 'X2' / 30 'thirty' 'X3' / 40 'forty' 'X4'",
		"",
		"Wrong-argument-count cases use Google Sheets as the oracle: Sheets surfaces",
		"'Wrong number of arguments' as #N/A, while Excel refuses the formula at entry",
		"and so has no value to compare against.",
		"",
		"The corpus harness writes the formula under test into XFD1048576, so ROW()",
		"and COLUMN() with no argument are expected to report 1048576 and 16384."
	],
	"cases": [
		{
			"id": "fn-lookup-vlookup-exact-001",
			"formula": "=VLOOKUP(20,A1:C4,2,FALSE)",
			"cells": { "A1": 10, "B1": "ten", "C1": "X1", "A2": 20, "B2": "twenty", "C2": "X2", "A3": 30, "B3": "thirty", "C3": "X3", "A4": 40, "B4": "forty", "C4": "X4" },
			"expected": "twenty",
			"category": "lookup",
			"source": "excel-compatible-semantics"
		},
		{
			"id": "fn-lookup-vlookup-third-column-002",
			"formula": "=VLOOKUP(20,A1:C4,3,FALSE)",
